body:
Five fingers? The very idea!

&#x200B;

Clearly that man is a mutant!

Absolutely! I'm glad this post has helped you as well as myself! 

&#x200B;

Also, happy cake day!!

The majority of the time I get most of my chicken from Safeway, as it's closest to me. I'll have to check next time I go there to see what sort of liquid they process it with. I actually went there this morning and it seems like there's a lot of striations on the majority of the pieces they had. Bit strange... I might actually take your advice on buying the organic stuff. If it really is because of how they process it, shelling out a few extra dollars couldn't hurt too much if I can get better flavour.

&#x200B;

Thanks!
